          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "第一组为 $\\{0\\},(0,+\\infty),(-\\infty,0)$；第二组为 $\\{0\\},(-\\infty,0),(0,+\\infty)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "两组均为 $\\{0\\},\\ (0,+\\infty),\\ (-\\infty,0)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "两组均为 $\\varnothing,\\ \\mathbb R,\\ \\varnothing$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q690-source-graph",
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "观察图中的三条曲线。哪些关于它们相互位置的陈述成立？",
