          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "若 $0.3^k=100$，则 $k<0$；若 $0.4^k=18$，也有 $k<0$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "若 $7^k=1.003$，则 $k=0$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
